ungen sind hochgradig anpassbar und k\u00f6nnen f\u00fcr eigene Projekte genutzt werden.", "short_description": "Artivact ist ein kostenloses, quelloffenes Werkzeug zur Sammlungsverwaltung und -pr\u00e4sentation.\nMit Artivact XR kannst du diese Sammlungen in der virtuellen Realit\u00e4t erleben."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "quest_portrait.png", "id": "4209759382644599", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473393841_4209759385977932_3266183942185304833_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=62boyXarzQAQ7kNvwFTjqEY&_nc_oc=Adp_UHK4SVK_qWW0g6zl0FwrrgcRN498bCOiqjgN7YGxIphatgSH-tds8C55H42xjWY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af9Pvl22KRdBz_CVgdX0tSGREaO2_T7rJuiH_oWLXcBk7w&oe=6A2EC6FC"}, {"file_name": "quest_hero_cover.png", "id": "1263316755151138", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499292244_1263316758484471_159357681156275043_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=y8fKLEuKZYEQ7kNvwHVSi6S&_nc_oc=AdqLadO-gOXnPAuJhDj9i26c8E3m5QinGvS2LTB_Dir5WqTNhPKJlzhPO8bsZK9Arnw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af8JJ-bxgVyEbjSNUZTpyBLrZb0SAFmA39Mk-n-JrauyNQ&oe=6A2EAB16"}, {"file_name": "quest_landscape.png", "id": "1039024501005104", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473393450_1039024504338437_7487200977707356540_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=4eGh1JBtYPgQ7kNvwEKBI9O&_nc_oc=Adoux1BwEWFhCAVXsU5d71Z3m569VPhbWEiHyTZRhnhhEzk8zi7Zqcg5i0YYzUzxbEQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af98Oh-VbAZOnFr5ciVz9Xccti0Yt3HOoGFH-DLDxzMv3Q&oe=6A2EB8E4"}, {"file_name": "quest_logo.png", "id": "707346191636121", "image_type": "APP_IMG_LOGO_TRANSPARENT", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499302233_707346198302787_7894586970020286030_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_